  (text "J601: Wurth 62705020621; mating cable socket 62705023121. Pin numbers are physical header contacts, top view.\nHeader land: 50 pads, 1.27 mm longitudinal pitch, 0.65 x 2.76 mm pads, rows at +/-2.02 mm.\nOnly low-voltage signals and the separate +5V_C branch cross this connector. Pin 49 reserved / NC.\nP5V_C protection and P_ALIVE are implemented in control-supply; physical qualification remains open.\nBrake/status, bus/temperature sources and I/O back-power protection are incomplete.\nDo not tie P5V_C directly to P5V. Cable continuity, key orientation, mechanical retention and total signal path need qualification.\nNo powered mating; no first-mate/last-break or connector-based safety guarantee is claimed."
    (at 30 135 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "742c83d9-160d-4567-9898-1e2663631dbb")
  )
